@token =

### Get HSK progress for all levels
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/daily-dragon/hsk/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit reviews (also triggers check_and_promote after each batch)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/daily-dragon/vocabulary/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reviews": [
        {"word": "你好", "quality": 8},
        {"word": "谢谢", "quality": 9}
    ]
}
